<title>UK: TABLE-Alliance H1 profits down three pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Alliance H1 profits down three pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.4	 vs 20.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.4	  vs notional 5.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     177.6	vs 183.4</p>
<p> Operating income	 553.5	vs 547.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 179 and 194 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name of bank - Alliance &amp; Leicester Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
